IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ita-types`
IMPORT `ita-rates`
IMPORT `ita-reliefs`
IMPORT `cpf-contributions`
IMPORT `cpf-wages-year`
IMPORT `sg-household`

-- A Singapore household's income tax and employee CPF -- worked cases.
--
-- Every expected value is worked by hand from the Act's text (the Second Schedule's bands; s 39 and the Fifth Schedule's amounts; the First Schedule's
-- employee column), with the working in the comment above it. None is taken from IRAS, PolicyEngine-SG or Lexifina's model. Where a case turns on a reading
-- the Act leaves open, the fork is named (H1 to H8 in NOTES.md). A failing assertion is a finding: no expected value was edited to match the code.
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of overrides on a base adult and a base child (a scratchpad script, as for cpf-cases-*.l4); the expected values were
-- written by hand. Dates: each adult is born in December, so that the age at 31 December is the year minus the year of birth and the CPF band changes
-- in January of the year after.

§ `Fixtures`

`a month of pay` ow aw MEANS `My pay in one month` OF ow, aw

`twelve months of` ow MEANS
    LIST (`a month of pay` ow 0), (`a month of pay` ow 0), (`a month of pay` ow 0), (`a month of pay` ow 0), (`a month of pay` ow 0), (`a month of pay` ow 0), (`a month of pay` ow 0), (`a month of pay` ow 0), (`a month of pay` ow 0), (`a month of pay` ow 0), (`a month of pay` ow 0), (`a month of pay` ow 0)

-- the figures of a household, or -1 where the encoding does not cover it
GIVEN h IS A `Household`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the income tax of` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the household's position` h
    WHEN NOTHING THEN 0 MINUS 1
    WHEN JUST p THEN p's `income tax of the household`

GIVEN h IS A `Household`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the employee CPF of` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the household's position` h
    WHEN NOTHING THEN 0 MINUS 1
    WHEN JUST p THEN p's `employee CPF of the household`

GIVEN h IS A `Household`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the net income of` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the household's position` h
    WHEN NOTHING THEN 0 MINUS 1
    WHEN JUST p THEN p's `net income of the household`

GIVEN h IS A `Household`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the parenthood rebate used by the first adult of` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the household's position` h
    WHEN NOTHING THEN 0 MINUS 1
    WHEN JUST p THEN p's `the first adult's position`'s `parenthood rebate used`

